<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I know how to be abased,</l><l>And I know how to abound,</l><l>To be filled, to hunger or lack,</l><l>In all things and in everything</l><l>I’ve learned the secret.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I am able to do all things</l><l>In Him who empowers me.</l><l>Nevertheless you did well</l><l>To have fellowship with me</l><l>In my affliction.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
